Package: shadshiny
Title: 'shadcn/ui' Components for 'Shiny'
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R:
    person("Arijit", "Ghosh", email = "arijitghosh2009@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A broad, experimental reimplementation of the 'shadcn/ui' design
    system for 'Shiny' applications. It provides 73 accessible, themeable
    components, written in plain CSS and JavaScript with no front-end
    framework and wrapped as R functions with 'Shiny' input bindings. They
    include field composition primitives, a data table, a questionnaire
    workflow, layout and page-shell primitives, dashboard value boxes,
    sparklines and chart theming, keyboard, code, scroll and shimmer
    utilities, a server-side form validator, custom and registry-imported
    themes, and a streaming chat module. The components coexist with
    'Bootstrap 5' and 'bslib', and follow their dark mode automatically.
